		i. Data Loss Prevention
			§ Avoid data exfiltration
			§ Can happens at many  places e.g. on devices, over network, data at rest, data on move
			§ Track emails from coming in and going out. In-bound email DLP, out--bound email DLP.
			i. Removable Media
				§ Block removable devices like USB
			ii. Data Exfiltration
				§ Important/proprietary data leaving network without authorization
				
			iii. Endpoint DLP system
				§ On individual devices and monitor inflow and outflow of data
				§ Alerts admin about suscpicious activities
			iv. Network based DLP
				§ h/w or s/w On network perimeter and monitors data entering and leaving the perimeter
				§ Alerts about suspicious activities
			v. Storage based DLP
				§ S/w installed on servers in the data center to inspects the data at rest
			vi. Cloud based DLP
				§ Located between users and internet, watches every byte of data network traffic
				§ Block custom defined data strings like secret, important etc.
				§ Manage URLS to prevent file transfers to cloud storage
				§ Block viruses and malware
				
